    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f3ba9e94c3839a1fc3c1172",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "プリファイとキングさん…\r\n2人の師匠を持つ私は\r\nきっと最強になれるはず！",
      "source_fingerprint": "293c5122683d30ce097c464b075d7f178e2bcc8288106772f4cb3c7a8ec7dbd1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1039/92015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27300572eb3f06f2ce8fc749",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "華麗な舞のごとく…\r\n鋭く！苛烈な足さばき！\r\nごらんに入れますわ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34370bf3093a5e0a6d228c86be4549754b4fdcda709fac19f97491c126f417d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1039/92016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fef406911d55b771fa086d99",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "清く激しく勇ましく！\r\n日々鍛錬を行ってこそ三女神さまの\r\n加護も得られるというものですわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa15842a9c25da316c2813aca54ec212b0da7a65a2e27de2ff70f1b7d3784ab4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
        "92017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1039/92017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:328b9e90da76f0e0bfcd584a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーニング中も、\r\n常に舞台に立つ気持ちで\r\n挑みますわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3e856b6286798131c51a382e2024b7fd328bbdda9761ef3e42bacab7ebda78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1039",
